<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine money market closed for local elections.</title>
<headline>Philippine money market closed for local elections.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine money market is closed on Monday for local district elections.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, the Manila overnight money dipped to an average of 11.28125 percent from 11.3125 percent due to the prevailing high liquidity in the system.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
